  "definition": "Firearms Training Requirement",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-11-16",
  "historyNote": "#1534, eff 2-17-80; ss by #1988, eff 3-25-82; ss by #2783, eff 7-27-84; ss by #4437, eff 6-22-88; ss by #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7302, eff 6-8-00; amd by #8926, eff 7-1-07; ss by #9168, INTERIM, eff 6-3-08, EXPIRES: 11-30-08; ss by #9224, eff 8-1-08; ss by #10780, eff 3-1-15; ss by #12041, eff 11-16-16",
